# Multi-modal AI Chat Example
# This example demonstrates how to use multi-modal features in the TUI

# First, launch the TUI
# ae --tui

# In the TUI:
# 1. Switch to Media tab (press 3 or Tab until you reach Media)
# 2. Add some image files (press 'o' to open - placeholder in demo)
# 3. Switch back to Chat tab (press 1)
# 4. Select media files in the Media sidebar
# 5. Type your message and press Enter

# Example conversation:
goal := "Analyze the image and describe what you see in detail"

# The TUI will automatically process multi-modal inputs when media is attached
"What do you see in this image?" | ai | print

# For agent-based analysis:
agent goal ["print", "ls"] 5 | print
